menu "AirGradient Go"

    config AGO_BLE_SECURITY_ENABLED
        bool "Enable BLE authenticated access"
        default y
        help
            Enable BLE pairing/bonding security for the AirGradient Go custom
            GATT service. When disabled, development builds expose the Status,
            Config, and History characteristics without authenticated access.

    config TRACKING_FSYNC_INTERVAL_MS
        int "Tracking fsync interval (ms)"
        range 1000 600000
        default 30000
        help
            Maximum age of unsynced route points before append_route_point()
            forces an fflush + fsync. Bounds worst-case data loss on a
            power cut. Lower = safer; higher = less NAND wear.

endmenu
